      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofalgonac.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Algonac Clay Maritime Museum displays historic Chris‑Craft and Gar Wood boats built right here.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
