      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Algonac%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Dubbed the Pickerel Capital of the World, Algonac boasts a rich heritage of fishing, shipbuilding, and power‑boat racing.",
